mn annualised means growth needs little"],[13.889,43.572,7.394,1.809,1.634,"new capex."],[13.889,46.034,52.931,1.809,1.634,"Our Dec-27 target of ₹27,250 averages 37x the twelve-month EPS after Dec-27"],[13.889,47.502,52.931,1.809,1.634,"(₹932), or ₹34,476, and a ten-year FCFE DCF at an 11% cost of equity and"],[13.889,48.946,52.934,1.809,1.634,"6.5% terminal growth plus Dec-27 net cash, or ₹20,013. At ₹31,105 the shares"],[13.889,50.39,52.957,1.809,1.634,"are 37x FY28E and 33x that forward EPS; the DCF needs free cash flow to grow"],[13.889,51.834,52.934,1.809,1.634,"16.2% a year to FY37, against 8.7% we forecast. The multiple leg alone implies"],[13.889,53.278,52.934,1.809,1.634,"11%; the cash flow leg is the call. Listed peers trade at 16.7x forward and Page’s"],[13.889,54.722,52.964,1.809,1.634,"own three-year average is 57x, which we do not use as a leg. Consensus of"],[13.889,56.167,52.934,1.809,1.634,"₹37,659 (26 analysts, 15 buy) is 21% above the price. What would prove us"],[13.889,57.611,52.936,1.809,1.634,"wrong: gross margin above 58% on 12% volume growth, or the ₹8,000 cr target"],[13.889,59.055,6.505,1.809,1.634,"delivered."],[13.889,61.542,13.042,1.643,1.471,"Price Performance"],[13.961,70.154,2.796,1.022,0.915,"25,000"],[13.961,68.386,2.796,1.022,0.915,"30,000"],[13.961,66.618,2.796,1.022,0.915,"35,000"],[13.961,64.851,2.796,1.022,0.915,"40,000"],[13.961,63.083,2.796,1.022,0.915,"45,000"],[18.158,70.848,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Jan 26"],[22.718,70.848,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Apr 26"],[27.522,70.848,2.47,1.022,0.915,"Jul 26"],[32.309,70.848,2.96,1.022,0.915,"Oct 26"],[17.948,72.043,4.623,1.275,1.111,"PAGEIND ("],[22.574,72.069,0.618,1.241,1.111,"₹"],[23.187,72.043,0.303,1.275,1.111,")"],[26.271,72.043,7.901,1.275,1.111,"NIFTY 50 (rebased)"],[20.285,73.179,1.972,1.387,1.209,"YTD"],[25.556,73.179,1.433,1.387,1.209,"1m"],[30.276,73.179,1.433,1.387,1.209,"3m"],[34.446,73.179,1.984,1.387,1.209,"12m"],[15.277,74.244,1.691,1.387,1.209,"Abs"],[18.784,74.244,3.394,1.387,1